@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF6EB
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontColor #291B1D
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #BA3143
skinparam activityBackgroundColor white
skinparam activityBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #D8F24B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDF6
skinparam noteBorderColor #BA3143
title Domain class diagram — based on ERD v5
hide empty methods
top to bottom direction
class Event <<events>> {
  {field} id: bigint
  {field} name: text
  {field} event_date: date
  {field} location: text
  {field} created_at: timestamptz
}
class Category <<categories>> {
  {field} id: bigint
  {field} event_id: bigint
  {field} name: text
  {field} distance_km: numeric(5,2)
  {field} min_age: int
}
class Runner <<runners>> {
  {field} id: uuid
  {field} category_id: bigint
  {field} bib_number: text {unique}
  {field} name: text
  {field} date_of_birth: date
  {field} gender: text (M/F)
  {field} id_type: text
  {field} id_number: text
  {field} email: text
  {field} phone: text
  {field} jersey_size: text
  {field} parental_consent: boolean
  {field} created_at: timestamptz
}
class ChipResult <<chip_results>> {
  {field} id: uuid
  {field} runner_id: uuid {unique}
  {field} start_time: timestamptz
  {field} finish_time: timestamptz
  {field} elapsed_seconds: int
  {field} avg_pace_sec_km: numeric(6,2)
  {field} category_rank: int
  {field} overall_rank: int
  {field} start_status: text
  {field} finisher: boolean
}
class ChipSplit <<chip_splits>> {
  {field} id: uuid
  {field} runner_id: uuid
  {field} km_marker: int
  {field} split_seconds: numeric(6,2)
}
class StravaMetrics <<strava_metrics>> {
  {field} id: uuid
  {field} runner_id: uuid {unique}
  {field} avg_heartrate: int
  {field} max_heartrate: int
  {field} elevation_gain_m: numeric(7,2)
  {field} calories: int
  {field} avg_cadence: int
  {field} connected_at: timestamptz
}
class FotoYuPhoto <<fotoyu_photos>> {
  {field} id: uuid
  {field} bib_number: text
  {field} photo_url: text
  {field} photographer: text
  {field} captured_km: int
  {field} captured_at: timestamptz
}
Event "1" -- "1..*" Category : contains
Category "1" -- "1..*" Runner : groups
Runner "1" -- "1" ChipResult : has result
Runner "1" -- "1..*" ChipSplit : has recorded splits
Runner "1" -- "0..1" StravaMetrics : optional enrichment
Runner "1" -- "0..*" FotoYuPhoto : matched by bib_number
ChipResult -[hidden]right- ChipSplit
ChipSplit -[hidden]right- StravaMetrics
StravaMetrics -[hidden]right- FotoYuPhoto
note bottom of Runner
  Attributes and associations follow the ERD v5 image.
  One result / multiple splits express its started-runner model.
  ERD notes exclude DNS; lifecycle inconsistency remains OD-01.
  Physical schema permits zero results and zero splits.
end note
legend bottom
Seven domain classes mapped from the seven ERD v5 entities.
Plain UML associations; no unsupported inheritance or composition.
1..* preserves ERD v5's many-side model; current database allows empty parent groups.
No invented service methods or new database entities are added.
endlegend
@enduml
